  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Analys av upphandling</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Review of Procuremnt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to strengthen Sida&#xb4;s knowledge regarding national public procurement legislation within the sphere of countries of cooperation and to give recommendations for future Swedish support in this field, Peder Blomberg, Assistum AB has been assigned by Sida &#xd6;st, Division Western Balkans, to carry out a review of public procurement laws and feasibility mission on support to Public Procurement.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida &#xd6;st, Enheten f&#xf6;r V&#xe4;stra Balkan, har gett konsulten Peder Blomberg uppdraget att analysera kvalitet och anv&#xe4;ndbarhet av nationell lagstiftning vid upphandlingar med Sida medel. Projektets andra fas inneb&#xe4;r en f&#xf6;rstudie som ska ge Sida rekommendationer om det &#xe4;r relevant att ge projektst&#xf6;d till l&#xe4;ndernas upphandlingsmyndigheter.</narrative>
  </description>
